---
---
<section id="process" class="light sec" style="padding-top: 120px; padding-bottom: 120px; background: oklch(95.3% 0.007 197)">
<div class="wrap proc">
<div class="proc-panel">
<span class="mono" style="display: block; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2); margin-bottom: 20px">Process</span>
<h2 data-split="1" class="disp" style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 52px; line-height: 56px">The same four steps for every client</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 40px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 29px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2); max-width: 40ch">You always know what we are doing, what it costs and what comes next.</p>
<div class="vis" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 36px">
<div class="num-stack mega" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 200px; width: 260px; color: oklch(22.1% 0.033 223.9)"><span data-step-num="1">01</span><span data-step-num="1">02</span><span data-step-num="1">03</span><span data-step-num="1">04</span></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px">
<div data-step-vane="1" style="width: 72px; height: 72px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%); background: oklch(37.9% 0.061 216.2)"></div>
<div style="width: 3px; height: 160px; background: oklch(90.4% 0.014 207.9); position: relative"><div data-step-bar="1" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: oklch(37.9% 0.061 216.2); transform-origin: top"></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<ol data-steps="1" style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid oklch(90.4% 0.014 207.9)">
<li class="step" data-step="1">
<span class="mono" style="color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">01, 2 weeks</span>
<h3 class="disp" style="margin: 0; font-size: 44px; line-height: 48px">Audit</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2); max-width: 44ch">Two weeks inside your systems, licences and backups. We talk to the people who use them.</p>
</li>
<li class="step" data-step="1">
<span class="mono" style="color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">02, Week 3</span>
<h3 class="disp" style="margin: 0; font-size: 44px; line-height: 48px">Plan</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2); max-width: 44ch">One page. Every fix in priority order, each with a fixed price. You choose what goes ahead.</p>
</li>
<li class="step" data-step="1">
<span class="mono" style="color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">03, Ongoing</span>
<h3 class="disp" style="margin: 0; font-size: 44px; line-height: 48px">Run</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2); max-width: 44ch">The engineers who did the audit do the work, then answer your support calls.</p>
</li>
<li class="step" data-step="1">
<span class="mono" style="color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">04, Monthly</span>
<h3 class="disp" style="margin: 0; font-size: 44px; line-height: 48px">Report</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2); max-width: 44ch">A short report on what changed, what it cost and what we recommend next.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
